--- TARGET / PATH RECONCILIATION ----------------------------------------------
The prompt's nominal output path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/**` does not
exist in this repo and is NOT a compiled source root (project.yml compiles `Sources/`
+ `TeslaSync/{feature-views,shared-surfaces,dashboard-widgets,misc-surfaces,
widget-primitives}`). EVERY existing Apple admin page (DiskForecast, SlowQueries,
FeatureFlags, AuditLog, …) lives in `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/`, with tests
in `apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/`. To match the established convention AND be
compiled/linted/tested, the page was implemented there. (ADR-002: one shared SwiftUI
source group serves iOS + macOS.)

