--- ADAPTIVITY / HIG / a11y ---------------------------------------------------
Adaptive macOS(regular)/iOS(compact): tables -> columnar Grid (regular) / cards (compact);
header actions stack on compact. Materials via TSGlassPanel. Design tokens only (Color.TS,
Font.TS, TSSpacing, TSRadius) — light/dark + increased-contrast + Dynamic Type honored.
accessibilityLabel/traits on panels, chips, icon-only buttons; ContentUnavailableView for
empty; redacted ProgressView/TSTableSkeleton for loading; SF Symbol status with symbolEffect.
Strings 100% via LocalizedStringKey/String(localized:) with web key names (ADR-014).
Units: admin control-plane is unit-agnostic (bytes/counts/ms) — formatted at the display
boundary only (BackupFormat), no SI stored/computed (ADR — frontend SI-cutover N/A here).

